    <string-array name="fasting_tips">
        <item>Sela amanzi anele kwaye ucwangcise ukutya kwakho kwangaphambili. Khetha ukutya okunesondlo nokuzalisayo xa ukwazi ukutya, uphulaphule umzimba wakho ngalo lonke ixesha lokuzila.</item>
        <item>Amanzi, ikofu emnyama netiyi ecacileyo zihlala zilungile ngexesha lokuzila. Sela rhoqo ngemini.</item>
        <item>Yekisa ukuzila ngokucothayo ngokutya okulinganisiweyo kunokutya okukhulu kakhulu okanye okumnandi kakhulu.</item>
        <item>Uziva unesiyezi okanye ungaphilanga? Yekisa ukuzila utye into. Impilo yakho ibalulekile kuqala.</item>
        <item>Qala kancinci: qala ngokuzila kwexeshana elifutshane uze wandise ngokuthe ngcembe njengoko umzimba wakho uqhelana.</item>
    </string-array>
